flowchart TD
    accTitle: ImmersionCaption 0.4.0 caption commitment policy
    accDescr: Each partial or final hypothesis is processed immediately. After request continuation and revision alignment, a complete sentence takes priority. Otherwise a genuine final result commits the remaining text, or a partial can commit an eligible punctuation clause. There is no stability confirmation gate. Committed phrases enter a bounded sequential translation queue.

    Event["Apple Speech callback<br/>Cumulative text + request ID<br/>Actual isFinal + optional timings"]
    Active{"Current session/request<br/>and session running?"}
    Ignore["Ignore stale/inactive event"]
    Carry["On changed request ID:<br/>carry uncommitted tail<br/>reset revision/timing anchors"]
    Align["Combine carry + current text<br/>Align consumed position<br/>Keep latest text in Hearing"]

    subgraph Boundary["Decision for each remaining suffix · no stability confirmation gate"]
        Sentence{"Recognized sentence ending<br/>anywhere in pending text?"}
        Whole["Choose first sentence ending<br/>Keep earlier commas + closing quotes<br/>No maximum character length"]
        Final{"Actual isFinal = true?"}
        Tail["Choose entire remaining tail<br/>Keep its commas together"]
        Clause{"Eligible comma / colon / semicolon<br/>at character position 10 or later?"}
        Fragment["Choose first eligible clause ending<br/>Punctuation counts toward position<br/>Protect numeric commas / colons"]
        Wait["Retain unfinished text<br/>Wait for another recognition event<br/>No timer or pause flush"]
    end

    Commit["Advance consumed text/timing anchors<br/>Trim phrase; skip punctuation-only output<br/>Repeat decision for any remaining suffix"]
    Queue["Enqueue nonempty phrases<br/>At most 3 pending<br/>Overflow drops oldest pending phrase"]
    Model["One translation at a time<br/>Current phrase + last 2 translated pairs<br/>Local Ollama · completed response only"]
    Publish["If generation is still current:<br/>publish caption + append history<br/>No retroactive source correction"]
    Risk["A punctuated PARTIAL can be committed<br/>on its first appearance.<br/>Revision alignment prevents some replay;<br/>it does not establish recognition stability."]

    Event --> Active
    Active -->|"No"| Ignore
    Active -->|"Yes"| Carry
    Carry --> Align --> Sentence
    Sentence -->|"Yes"| Whole --> Commit
    Sentence -->|"No"| Final
    Final -->|"Yes"| Tail --> Commit
    Final -->|"No"| Clause
    Clause -->|"Yes"| Fragment --> Commit
    Clause -->|"No"| Wait
    Commit -->|"Next suffix, if any"| Sentence
    Commit -->|"Collect phrases, then"| Queue
    Queue --> Model --> Publish
    Align -.-> Risk

    classDef input fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#3b67b1,color:#172b4d
    classDef policy fill:#e8f5f1,stroke:#23836d,color:#153e35
    classDef output fill:#f2ecfc,stroke:#815bb3,color:#382254
    classDef warning fill:#fff1df,stroke:#b9822d,color:#513b16
    classDef idle fill:#f2f5f8,stroke:#73869a,color:#26384a
    class Event,Active,Carry,Align input
    class Sentence,Whole,Final,Tail,Clause,Fragment,Commit policy
    class Queue,Model,Publish output
    class Risk warning
    class Ignore,Wait idle
